flowchart TB
    subgraph Logistics[Logistics Modular Monolith]
        API[Task-oriented API]
        Application[Application contracts]
        Domain[Domain model]
        Infrastructure[Infrastructure services]
    end

    subgraph Aggregates[Consistency Boundaries]
        Voyage[VoyageCapacity aggregate root\nOwns held + confirmed <= total]
        Booking[Booking aggregate root\nOwns confirmation and active hold reference]
        Hold[CapacityHold aggregate root\nOwns Active -> Confirmed or Expired]
    end

    DB[(PostgreSQL authoritative store)]
    Outbox[Transactional Outbox]
    Inbox[Inbox + confirmation projection]

    API --> Application --> Infrastructure
    Infrastructure --> Domain
    Infrastructure --> Voyage
    Infrastructure --> Booking
    Infrastructure --> Hold
    Voyage -->|atomic conditional update| DB
    Booking --> DB
    Hold --> DB
    Infrastructure --> Outbox --> DB
    Infrastructure --> Inbox --> DB

    note[One deployable process; aggregate, table, and deployment boundaries are distinct]
    Domain --- note
